---
name: PDQI Accuracy Evaluator
description: Accuracy assesses whether the clinical note is factually correct and medically sound.
model:
  api: chat
  configuration:
    type: azure_openai
    azure_endpoint: ${env:AZURE_OPENAI_ENDPOINT}
    azure_deployment: gpt-4.1-mini
  parameters:
    model:
    temperature: 0.1
inputs:
  note:
    type: string
outputs:
  foods-to-be-avoided:
    type: list of string
  foods-to-be-taken:
    type: list of string
---

system:

Extract the food and dietrary information from the clinical note, the output needs to be in JSON format. Do not recommend anything outside the clinical notes, if there is no mention of the food so no need to include it.

"foods-to-be-avoided":"list of foods",
'foods-to-be-taken';'list of foods'

**Here the actual conversation to be scored:**
generated_query: {{note}}
output:
